{"3372060":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Hell Maiden","steam_appid":3372060,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3372060\/extras\/9e27e062b480cd24c51c31e1d058bec1.avif?t=1787047104\" width=800 height=206 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hell Maiden<\/strong> is an action <strong>Horde Survival Deck-Building<\/strong> game inspired by Dante's Divine Comedy. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Dante on a new adventure through Hell in search of a second chance at salvation.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3372060\/extras\/03952e8858099b7e028598ff25709240.poster.avif?t=1787047104\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3372060\/extras\/03952e8858099b7e028598ff25709240.webm?t=1787047104\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3372060\/extras\/03952e8858099b7e028598ff25709240.mp4?t=1787047104\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness great power by strategically <strong>building and organizing your deck<\/strong> of <strong>unique weapons and abilities<\/strong>, and prove your divine worth by facing off against hordes of blood-thirsty demons and climbing your way to Heaven!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3372060\/extras\/a05c219621625f4248d44b14e4ba22a0.avif?t=1787047104\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3372060\/extras_big\/a05c219621625f4248d44b14e4ba22a0.avif?t=1787047104 width=800 height=139 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3372060\/extras\/61279b715c1c9e7351f430396eb64128.poster.avif?t=1787047104\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3372060\/extras\/61279b715c1c9e7351f430396eb64128.webm?t=1787047104\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3372060\/extras\/61279b715c1c9e7351f430396eb64128.mp4?t=1787047104\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome the challenges of the afterlife and wreak havoc in all 9 Circles of Hell by creating <strong>unique deck builds<\/strong> and <strong>wielding mythical weapons<\/strong> to tackle endless waves of enemies and defeat Hell’s toughest fiends.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Better yet, you get to <strong>keep and use your opponents' signature abilities<\/strong> in your own deck!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3372060\/extras\/702d3053ae256a164193bc11e9cc46a0.avif?t=1787047104\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3372060\/extras_big\/702d3053ae256a164193bc11e9cc46a0.avif?t=1787047104 width=800 height=139 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3372060\/extras\/d2e54d9b82b7d47f217dc2a4700ae19a.poster.avif?t=1787047104\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3372060\/extras\/d2e54d9b82b7d47f217dc2a4700ae19a.webm?t=1787047104\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3372060\/extras\/d2e54d9b82b7d47f217dc2a4700ae19a.mp4?t=1787047104\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your favorite <strong>Spirit Cards<\/strong> and combine them with a myriad of different abilities, bonuses and status effects to create powerful builds and decimate your opponents. <br> <br>Equip <strong>Mod Cards<\/strong> to enhance and modify your <strong>Weapon Cards<\/strong> — edit, experiment, adapt,  and reformulate your hand and card combinations as you go and refine your personal playstyle!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3372060\/extras\/70cf65ee3c434cd712762d2a659a95be.avif?t=1787047104\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3372060\/extras_big\/70cf65ee3c434cd712762d2a659a95be.avif?t=1787047104 width=800 height=139 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3372060\/extras\/d6d6d6b98cb6310cee6839c821a7c7e4.poster.avif?t=1787047104\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3372060\/extras\/d6d6d6b98cb6310cee6839c821a7c7e4.webm?t=1787047104\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3372060\/extras\/d6d6d6b98cb6310cee6839c821a7c7e4.mp4?t=1787047104\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accompanied by the Roman poet <strong>Virgil<\/strong> and protected by the sanctified <strong>Beatrice<\/strong>, you must rescue and befriend the <strong>Poets of Limbo<\/strong> to <strong>unlock new abilities<\/strong> and <strong>perks<\/strong>, <strong>ultimate attacks <\/strong>and <strong>signature weapons<\/strong>! <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet all the legendary poets of antiquity including but not limited to <strong>Homer<\/strong>, <strong>Ovid<\/strong>, <strong>Horace<\/strong> and <strong>Lucan<\/strong>, and help them find their own way to salvation.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3372060\/extras\/d70af22593ad3b7bd63f6994c3389c9b.avif?t=1787047104\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3372060\/extras_big\/d70af22593ad3b7bd63f6994c3389c9b.avif?t=1787047104 width=800 height=139 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3372060\/extras\/e062a926f9cb12e9e5e6dd753ed7401f.poster.avif?t=1787047104\" width=800 height=325 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3372060\/extras\/e062a926f9cb12e9e5e6dd753ed7401f.webm?t=1787047104\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hell Maiden<\/strong> picks up from the ending of the original Divine Comedy by Dante Alighieri.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dante is now inexplicably back in Hell after having reached Paradiso — and she's lost all her memories to boot! Unable to remember anything about her past life or her first journey through Hell, Dante is determined to climb her way back to Heaven and once again come face to face with Paradiso's higher powers in search for answers. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A compelling story about passion, justice and love, <strong>Hell Maiden<\/strong> is more than a reimagining of the classic poem — it is the exciting continuation of its events!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3372060\/extras\/2a216a87c0374ee9c0d30941703267eb.avif?t=1787047104\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3372060\/extras_big\/2a216a87c0374ee9c0d30941703267eb.avif?t=1787047104 width=800 height=171 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✦ <strong>Two<\/strong> unique levels themed around the <strong>Circles of Hell<\/strong> — each with <strong>new<\/strong> <strong>enemies to beat<\/strong>, <strong>quests<\/strong> and <strong>challenges<\/strong> to complete, <strong>Poets<\/strong> of Limbo to rescue and <strong>tough Boss Battles<\/strong> to overcome!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✦ <strong>40+ abilities<\/strong> to mix, match and experiment with.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✦ <strong>5 new abilities<\/strong> per rescued Poet of Limbo.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✦ <strong>2 new abilities<\/strong> per defeated Boss.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✦ A compelling, <strong>all-encompassing narrative<\/strong> to drive your adventure.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✦ <strong>4 Poets of Limbo<\/strong> to rescue and befriend across the two Circles of Hell.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✦ And more!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3372060\/extras\/75bae6dc409fe1327e1328ebb7812f17.avif?t=1787047104\" width=800 height=139 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img